  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v5.8.34 - on SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.4.54. Browser: ShaderCacheStore keeps the WebGPU shaders a visit generated (OPFS) and imports them on the next visit before any kernel loads, so a returning visitor skips ILGPU translating kernels to WGSL in the browser (MobileNetV2: a fresh accelerator first run 279-326 to 45-60 ms); on by default in the browser, stamped entries reject a rebuilt kernel. InferenceSession.RandomAtMean (random operators output their mean: the Stable Diffusion VAE encoders become deterministic) and RandomSeed (repeatable random operators).",
